SUMMARY:UNITED RENTALS — Call #3
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: UNITED RENTALS\nRoadshow: www.netroadshow.com/nrs/home/#!/?show=e6
 ffc7c0 | Passcode: United26 (not case-sensitive)\n\nDeal context:\nUnited 
 Rentals\, Inc. (rated Ba1 Positive/BBB- Stable\, split-rated straddling IG
 /HY) has mandated BofA Securities\, Goldman Sachs & Co. LLC\, and J.P. Mor
 gan to arrange fixed income investor calls on October 23\, 2026\, ahead of
  an expected SEC-registered\, USD-denominated senior unsecured fixed-rate 
 multi-tranche offering across 3-Year\, 5-Year\, and 10-Year tenors. The de
 al is subject to market conditions with no size or pricing terms disclosed
  at this mandate stage. Goldman Sachs & Co. LLC is coordinating logistics 
 for the investor call process\, with three call slots scheduled throughout
  the day.
